WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.219
Here is how to do this check. It takes about three minutes.

2
00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:08.614
Do not teach, and do not correct. Just listen, and tap what your child could do.

3
00:00:09.314 --> 00:00:14.094
Part A. Show your child the screen. Point to each letter, and your child says its sound.

4
00:00:14.544 --> 00:00:17.661
You want the sound, not the name of the letter. Like this.

5
00:00:21.982 --> 00:00:24.413
Tap each letter your child knows the sound of.

6
00:00:25.113 --> 00:00:30.884
Part B. Turn the screen away. You say the sounds of a word slowly, and your child says the word.

7
00:00:36.452 --> 00:00:37.466
The word is map.

8
00:00:38.266 --> 00:00:40.106
Tap each word your child gets.

9
00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:44.892
Part C. Show the screen again. Your child tries to read four words.

10
00:00:45.342 --> 00:00:47.657
Tap each word they read, however slowly.

11
00:00:48.107 --> 00:00:51.017
Then choose what happened with the words they could not read.

12
00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:56.399
Last, tap the pink button. The page tells you the reason, and what to do tonight.
